#: ../../../introduction/screenshots.rst:163 a42a9c3bbda5483999744f91aaa2492c
msgid ""
"Qubes desktop with windows open from different qubes running Windows, each "
"with own color assigned."
msgstr ""
"Qubes 桌面開啟了來自執行 Windows 的不同 qube 的視窗，每個都有自己分配的顏色。"
